{"ID":"20240504164236-wyzcg35","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504164236-wyzcg35","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504164236-wyzcg35\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621103505-mu0moiq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611084520-ythub2q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611084839-7054jha\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"123蜜蜡","type":"doc","updated":"20240811162943"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240621103505-mu0moiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621103505-mu0moiq","updated":"20240621103505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621102600-ytqzftv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 546px;","style":"width: 536px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621102650-scys3r7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 536px;\" parent-style=\"width: 546px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811162943-2a38hhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811162943-2a38hhy","updated":"20240811162943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜂蜡"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜂蜡-20240811162735-407yedv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 544px;\" parent-style=\"width: 554px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜂蜡 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜂蜡 1-20240811162828-b9zau2c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 544px;\" parent-style=\"width: 554px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611084839-7054jha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084839-7054jha","updated":"20240621103534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：蜜蜡即蜂蜡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084839-n8u0nco","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084839-n8u0nco"}},{"ID":"20240611084840-5lfwaa9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084840-5lfwaa9","updated":"20240611084840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084840-jv48obq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084840-jv48obq","updated":"20240611084840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084840-ljhvpk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084840-ljhvpk9","updated":"20240611084840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主下利脓血，补中续绝伤金创，益气不饥耐老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084840-nt15i96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084840-nt15i96","updated":"20240611084840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生武都蜜房木石间。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084840-7xpeqik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084840-7xpeqik","updated":"20240611084840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案西京杂记云：南越王献高帝蜜蜡，二百枚。玉篇云：蜡，蜜滓。陶宏景云：白蜡生于蜜中。故谓蜜蜡。《说文》无蜡字。张有云：腊别蜡，非，旧作蜡，今据改。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084618-j50dv55","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084618-j50dv55"}},{"ID":"20240611084745-tqn04rc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084745-tqn04rc","updated":"20240611084750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084745-wf2yk3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084745-wf2yk3w","updated":"20240611084745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味淡．入手太阴足厥阴经．功专调气．得茯苓治阳虚遗浊带下．黄蜡得黄连阿胶治痢下腹痛．面青肢冷效．得当归阿胶黄连黄柏陈仓米．治产后下痢．"}]},{"ID":"20240611084706-a0o8f70","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084706-a0o8f70"}},{"ID":"20240611084733-pac5rfp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084733-pac5rfp","updated":"20240611084740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084733-ne3c118","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084733-ne3c118","updated":"20240611084733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡平无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084733-ghk7hf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084733-ghk7hf5","updated":"20240611084733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤金疮，益气不饥耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084733-8s07ilv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084733-8s07ilv","updated":"20240611084733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜成于蜡。万物之至味，莫甘于蜜，莫淡于蜡，得非浓此薄彼耶。仲景治痢有调气饮，《千金》治痢有胶蜡汤。盖有见于《本经》之义也。淡为五味之本，胃为五脏之源，故能补中续伤，盖有得于太极也。甄权治孕妇胎动下血不绝欲死，以鸡子大一枚煎三五沸，投美酒半斤服立瘥。又能解毒，故蜡矾丸用之为君。华佗治下痢，食入即吐，用白蜡方寸匙，鸡子黄一枚，石蜜、苦酒、发灰、黄连末各半，鸡子壳，先煎蜜蜡苦酒，鸡子四味令匀，乃纳连末，发灰熬至可丸乃止，二日服尽神效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084712-gq36rw6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084712-gq36rw6"}},{"ID":"20240611084717-j6kgheh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084717-j6kgheh","updated":"20240611084729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084717-5xl4txp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084717-5xl4txp","updated":"20240611084717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜂房如脾。谓之蜜脾。蜜脾之底为蜡。取蜜后。炼过。滤入水中。候凝取之。色黄者。名黄蜡。更用水煮化。以好绵纸折作数层。入冷水蘸湿。遂贴蜡上。一吸即起。仍投冷水中。有蜡凝纸上。即剥取之。再吸再剥。以尽为度。铺竹器中曝之。干则频洒以水。久之色白如练。因名白蜡。非新白而久黄也。与虫造白蜡不同类。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084717-4c2y1h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084717-4c2y1h6","updated":"20240611084717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘淡。微温。恶芫花齐蛤。本经主下痢脓血。补中。续绝伤（能益血而行经脉）金疮。益气。别录疗泄后重见白脓。利小儿。蜜气味俱浓。性缓质柔。故润脏腑而养脾。蜡气味俱之别于本补之。倾投美酒半长肉。得腻柏猪胆汁炙子黄一个。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084717-g3u68l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084717-g3u68l6","updated":"20240611084717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"止。二日服者。用黄蜡汤。治热痢陈廪米半咳嗽音化作不语后。太去渣者〔论〕蜡味初尝微甘。即转为淡。五味以淡为本。今淡先有甘。是从中土而为扶危救困之味此物凝蜜治痢不纳昧者谓缪氏云。火热暴痢。不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084651-haus61k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084651-haus61k"}},{"ID":"20240611084703-zvh1ug1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084703-zvh1ug1","updated":"20240611084710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084703-3el6d9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084703-3el6d9e","updated":"20240611084703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微温。主下利脓血。补中续绝伤金创。益气不饥耐老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084703-4wcmi12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084703-4wcmi12","updated":"20240611084703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荒崖采采。蒙纩缠腰。支饥淡泊。嚼味寂寥。技羞栀貌。奢戒薪烧。何来灵雀。蜜塞相招。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084703-9skxuxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084703-9skxuxj","updated":"20240611084703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顾况序。采蜡怨奢也。荒岩之间。纩蒙其身。腰藤造险。又诗。采采者蜡。博物志。食蜡半斤。支十日饥。高骈诗。淡泊供需不在求。楞严经。味如嚼蜡。李商隐诗。红壁寂寥崖蜜尽。柳宗元文。栀其貌。蜡其言。以求贾技于朝。晋书传。石崇奢靡相尚。以蜡代薪。博物志。南方诸山。余蜡在石。有鸟群来啄之殆尽。名曰灵雀。人谓之蜜塞。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084618-9kuavkn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084618-9kuavkn"}},{"ID":"20240611084647-9xu63ir","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084647-9xu63ir","updated":"20240611084655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084647-d4ismd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084647-d4ismd0","updated":"20240611084647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温，无毒。主下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤金疮，益气不饥，耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084618-r7w6d1t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084618-r7w6d1t"}},{"ID":"20240611084635-ammhyyc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084635-ammhyyc","updated":"20240611084642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084635-vlh2ykp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084635-vlh2ykp","updated":"20240611084635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘，微温，无毒，主治下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤金疮，益气，不饥耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084635-3egdm7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084635-3egdm7g","updated":"20240611084635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蜜蜡乃蜜脾底也，取蜜后将底炼过，滤入水中候凝，取之即成蜡矣。今人谓之黄蜡，以其生自蜜中，故名蜜蜡。黄蜜之底，其色则黄，白蜜之底，其色则白，但黄者多，而白者少，故又名黄蜡。汪机《本草会编》∶一种虫白蜡，乃是小虫，所作其虫食冬青树汁，叶涎粘嫩茎上，化为白脂，至秋刮取，以水煮溶，滤置冷水中，则凝聚成块，此虫白蜡也，与蜜蜡之白者不同。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084635-pnhu2oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084635-pnhu2oe","updated":"20240611084635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜂采花心，酿成蜜蜡，蜜味甘，蜡味淡，禀阳明太阴土金之气，故主补中益气。蜜蜡味淡，今日甘者，淡附于甘也。主治下痢脓血，补中，言蜜蜡得阳明中土之气，治下痢脓血，以其能补中也。续绝伤金疮，益气，言蜜蜡得太阴金精之气，续金疮之绝伤，以其能益气也。补中益气，故不饥耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084618-lltuqde","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084618-lltuqde"}},{"ID":"20240611084624-ferppea","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084624-ferppea","updated":"20240611084630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084624-l9jhmmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084624-l9jhmmv","updated":"20240611084624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡甘温炼去黄，止血益气续绝伤，下痢胎漏金疮妙，长肉生肌浓胃肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084624-bm9y9q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084624-bm9y9q9","updated":"20240611084624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜡，猎也。蜂猎百花酿蜜，渣为蜡。初极香软，经酒、醋煮炼便黄赤，再煎炼，水中烊十数过即白。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084624-grhcotw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084624-grhcotw","updated":"20240611084624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主下痢脓血后重，妊孕胎动，漏血不绝欲死，金疮出血，皆能止之。兼补中益气，续绝伤，小儿尤宜。久服耐老不饥。恶芫花、文蛤。治雀目方∶黄蜡溶化，入蛤粉相和得所，每二钱以猪肝二两批开，糁药在内扎定，煮熟取出，乘热熏眼至温冷，并肝食之，以平为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084600-fuimcci","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084600-fuimcci"}},{"ID":"20240611084610-qv6iymr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-qv6iymr","updated":"20240611084616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084610-tigf45l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-tigf45l","updated":"20240611084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084610-yceh5ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-yceh5ua","updated":"20240611084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】甘，微温，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084610-1p6990g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-1p6990g","updated":"20240611084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主下痢浓血，补中，续绝伤金疮，益气，不饥，耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084610-dqdadyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-dqdadyq","updated":"20240611084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶蜡，蜜脾也。埤雅云∶其房如脾，故谓之蜜脾。一名蜡蜂，蜡生于蜜，而天下之味莫甘于蜜，莫淡于蜡，旧说蜂之化蜜，必取 猪之水，注之蜡房，而后蜜成，故谓之蜡。蜡者，蜜之 也。修事，取蜜后，缓火炼化，滤入水中，其色黄，俗名黄蜡。更用水煮化，以好绵纸折作数层，入冷水中蘸湿，遂贴蜡上，一吸即起，仍投冷水中，有蜡凝纸上者，即剥取之，再吸再剥，以尽为度。铺竹扁内，日中暴之，干则频洒以水，久之则色白如练，因名白蜡，非新白而久黄也。与虫造白蜡不同类。恶芫花、齐蛤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084610-p4zswwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-p4zswwo","updated":"20240611084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶蜜，密也。蜡，合也。蜡为蜜房，合密以成酝酿者也。味甘气温，居中色黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084610-tvfs2dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084610-tvfs2dw","updated":"20240611084610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对治胃不合密，遂痢脓血，更续金疮之不合密，肉理肌肤，胃府之所司尔。益气者，益胃土之（蜡为蜜脾，裨助百芳以化蜜也。蜜甘而蜡淡，非浓彼而薄此，犹夫瓜甜而蒂苦，所以见中枢之别于本末内外也。月令定五行，作五味，归五藏，素问另出淡味为五味本。凡形藏不足者，各以其味以补之。倾颓者，专以淡味以维之。本经判味曰甘，此指着舌时，犹有蜜味在，嚼之蜜味去，真味现矣。淡不厌，质可久，不饥耐老者以此。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084822-cy3uadm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084822-cy3uadm","updated":"20240611084822"}},{"ID":"20240611084822-36bl6zc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084822-36bl6zc","updated":"20240611084822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜡《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084822-tvzovpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084822-tvzovpu","updated":"20240611084822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（卵生）蜜蜡入胃绝痢入肝活血 虫蜡生肌活血"}]},{"ID":"20240611084822-4fsb729","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084822-4fsb729","updated":"20240611084822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜡（专入肝脾）。本有二。一出于蜂蜜之滓而成。即蜜凝结之粗者也。其蜡有黄有白。一出于树之蜡。其蜡由木之虫而得。故又名虫白蜡。（白蜡有二）二者气味不同。性亦微别。如蜜蜡味淡性平。其蜡本由蜜成。蜜本润物。则蜡亦润。故能主润脏腑经络。而有绝续补伤生肌之妙。（甄权治孕妇胎动下血不绝欲死。以鸡子大一枚煎三五沸。投美酒半升立瘥。）蜡止存蜜粗粕。其性最涩。故又能止泻绝痢。（仲景治痢有调气饮。千金治痢有胶蜡汤。华佗治下痢食即吐。用白蜡方寸匙。鸡子黄一枚。石蜜同苦酒发灰黄连末各半鸡子壳。先煎蜜蜡苦酒鸡子四味令匀。乃纳连末灰发。熬至可丸乃止。二日服尽。神效。）今人以情不投而曰嚼蜡。即味淡之意也。又凡荡除下焦之药。以此裹丸。亦其免伤上部之意。蜜蜡之用如此。至于虫蜡。系生蜡树所产。蜡树属金。性最坚强。虫食其叶而成。味甘气温。按甘益血补中。温能通经活络。故书载能止痛生肌补虚绝续。与桑螵蛸同有补虚之意。可为外科圣药。是以郑赞寰云。汪御章尿血。用白蜡加于凉血滋肾药中。遂愈。又书云。用此合合欢皮。同入长肉膏中神效。又治下疳。服之未成即消。已成即敛。以半两入鲫鱼腹中煮食。治肠红神效。则知虫蜡亦皆生肌活血之味。但蜜蜡味甘淡涩微温。虫蜡则味甘不淡而温也。蜜蜡因有涩性。可以止泻治痢。虫蜡涩性差减。而痢则鲜用也。蜜蜡本于蜂蜜之气。仅得甘之余气而成。而所主在胃。虫蜡得树收敛坚强之气。而所治专在筋肉骨血也。二者微似之中。恍惚之际。不可不知。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084503-7o7wjls","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084503-7o7wjls"}},{"ID":"20240611084546-zr13y7h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084546-zr13y7h","updated":"20240611084551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084546-tdg18vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084546-tdg18vz","updated":"20240611084546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温，无毒。主下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤，金疮，益气，不饥，耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084546-tx18t61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084546-tx18t61","updated":"20240611084546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白蜡"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗久泄 后重见白脓，补绝伤，利小儿。久服轻身不饥。生武都山谷，生于蜜房、木陶隐居云∶此蜜蜡尔，生于蜜中，故谓蜜蜡。蜂皆先以此为蜜跖（音只），煎蜜亦得之，初时极香软。人更煮炼，或加少醋、酒，便黄赤，以作烛色为好。今药家皆应用白蜡，但取削之，于夏月日曝百日许，自然白。卒用之，亦可烊，纳水中十余过，亦白。俗方∶唯以合疗下丸，而《仙经》断谷最为要用，今人但嚼食方寸者，亦一日不饥也。唐本注云∶除蜜字为佳，蜜已见石蜜条中也。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶白蜡，使，味甘，平，无毒。主妊孕妇人胎蜡如鸡子大，煎消三、五沸，美酒半斤投之，服之瘥。主白发，镊去，消蜡点孔中，即生黑者。和松脂、杏仁、枣肉、茯苓等分合成，食后服五十丸，便不饥，功用甚多。又云∶主下痢脓血。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084546-edcpvn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084546-edcpvn7","updated":"20240611084546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具石蜜条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084546-cnl8601","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084546-cnl8601","updated":"20240611084546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛氏方∶治犬咬人重发。疗之火炙蜡，灌入疮中。又方∶治狐尿刺入肿痛。用热蜡着疮中，又烟方∶湖南押衙颜思退传∶头风掣疼。蜡二斤，盐半斤相和，于 罗中熔令相入，捏作一兜鍪，势可合脑大小。搭头至额，头痛立止。集验方∶治雀目如神。黄蜡不以多少，器内熔成汁，取出，入蛤粉相和得所成球。每用以刀子切下二钱，以猪肝二两批开，掺药在内，麻绳扎定。水一碗，同热熏眼。至温，冷并肝食之，日二，以平安为度。姚和众∶治小儿脚冻，如有疮，即浓煎蜡，涂之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084546-k32nvtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084546-k32nvtx","updated":"20240611084546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义文具石蜜条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084533-aqij962","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084533-aqij962"}},{"ID":"20240611084533-48abx3b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084533-48abx3b","updated":"20240611084539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084533-tuzdho8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084533-tuzdho8","updated":"20240611084533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微温，无毒。主下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤，金疮，益气，不饥，耐老。白蜡，疗久泄 ，后重，见白脓，补绝伤，利小儿。久服轻身，不饥。生武都山谷。生于蜜房木石间。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084533-ca2ry3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084533-ca2ry3u","updated":"20240611084533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶芫花、齐蛤。此蜜蜡尔，生于蜜中，故谓蜜蜡。蜂皆先以此为蜜 ，煎蜜亦得之。初时极香软，人更煮炼，或加少醋酒，便黄赤，以作烛色为好。今药家皆应用白蜡，但取削之，于卒用之，亦可烊内水中十余过亦白。俗方惟以合疗下丸，而《仙经》断〔谨案〕除“蜜”字为佳，蜜以见石蜜条中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084504-yelylgk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084504-yelylgk"}},{"ID":"20240611084505-pfxdwjp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-pfxdwjp","updated":"20240611084509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-y9ki3nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-y9ki3nd","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、微温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-3a131if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-3a131if","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-xouoe8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-xouoe8p","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、赤白痢（腹痛难忍，里急后重）。用黄蜡三钱、阿胶三钱，同熔化，加黄连末五钱，搅匀，分三次热服。极效。此方名“仲景调气饮”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-mgrlv25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-mgrlv25","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、热痢及妇女产后下痢。用蜡两个子大小、职权胶二钱、当归二钱半、黄连三钱、黄蘖二钱、陈米半升，先用水三升，煮米至一升，去米入药，煎至一杯，温服。有特效。此方名“千金胶蜡汤”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-d3rls0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-d3rls0t","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、肺虚咳嗽（体倦肌瘦，发热减食）。用黄蜡（熔滤令净，浆水煮过）八两、化作一百二十丸，以蛤粉四两为衣。每服一丸，加胡桃半个，细嚼。温水送下。服药后静卧一段时间，闭口不语。一天二次。此方名“立效丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-ujhsxhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-ujhsxhm","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、肝虚雀目。用黄蜡不限量，熔成汁，加蛤粉适量调匀。每次用刀子切下二钱，夹进破开的二两猪肝中，麻绳捆定，煮熟。乘热熏眼。待水转温。取肝吃下。每日二次，直至病愈。其效极验。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-zust6ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-zust6ev","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、脚上冻疮。浓煎黄蜡涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-2esetma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-2esetma","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、汤火伤疮，红肿成脓。用麻油四两、当归一两，煎焦去渣，加黄蜡一两搅化，放冷后摊布上贴好，极效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-ucl7lw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-ucl7lw0","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、呃逆不止。用黄蜡烧烟熏二、三次即止。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084505-b6zmg8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084505-b6zmg8k","updated":"20240611084505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、各种疮毒（臁疮、刀伤、汤火等疮）。用黄蜡一两、香油二两、黄丹半两，同化开，收存瓶中，备用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084510-taix3en","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084510-taix3en"}},{"ID":"20240611084520-4r46xfh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-4r46xfh","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜜蜡"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-5vn1w1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-5vn1w1l","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-ce7jvvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-ce7jvvz","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mì Là"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-79o7laf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-79o7laf","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-86o78qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-86o78qs","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜡（《肘后方》），蜜跖（《本草经集注》），蜂蜡（《现代实用中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-dihk0kn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-dihk0kn","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-756wfr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-756wfr3","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-a1euxtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-a1euxtj","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-pmcbyqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-pmcbyqz","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蜜蜂科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中华蜜蜂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"工蜂分泌的蜡质"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，经精制而成。春、秋二季，将取去蜂蜜后的蜂巢，入水锅中加热熔化，除去上层泡沫杂质，趁热过滤，放冷，蜂蜡即凝结成块，浮于水面，取出，即为黄蜡。黄蜡再经熬炼、脱色等加工过程，即成白蜡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-udg56oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-udg56oe","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-xie1v23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-xie1v23","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①黄蜡（《姚僧坦集验方》），又名：黄占（《种福堂公选良方》）。多为不规则的块状，大小不一，全体呈黄色或黄棕色，不透明或微透明。表面光滑，触之有油腻感。体轻，能浮于水面，冷时质软脆，碎断面颗粒性，用手搓捏，能软化。有蜂蜜样香气，味演，嚼之细腻而粘。不溶于水，可溶干醚及氯仿中。以色黄、纯净、质较软而有油腻感、显蜂蜜样香气者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-ne48lt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-ne48lt7","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②白蜡（《别录》），又名：蜂白蜡。为白色块状。质较纯。气味较微弱，其它均与黄蜡同。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-78gjgsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-78gjgsx","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全国大部地区均有生产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-u305s3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-u305s3x","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-0260x4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-0260x4o","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜂蜡（蜜蜡）主要成分可分为4大类，即酯类、游离酸类、游离醇类和烃类。此外还含微量的挥发油及色素。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-vkk3nwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-vkk3nwl","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在酯类中有软脂酸蜂花酯（约占80％，是蜂蜡主要成分），蜡酸蜂花酯落花生油酸蜂花酯；在游离酸类中有蜡酸（约占15％），廿四酸，褐煤酸，蜂花酸，叶虱酸，落花生油酸，新蜡酸即廿五酸；在游离醇类中有正廿八醇，蜂花醇；在烃类中有廿五烷，廿七烷，廿九烷，卅一烷及不饱和的蜂花烯。以上所举，是一概略，例如所含脂酸可能包括从C24至C34的偶数碳的正脂酸，醇类可能包括从C24至C34的偶数碳的伯醇。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-lv3xj9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-lv3xj9w","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄、白两种蜂蜡的成分，基本相同。蜂蜡据称尚含一种芳香性有色吻质，名为虫蜡素。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-4cfvruk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-4cfvruk","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-updu5cb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-updu5cb","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入脾、胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-t0wvjg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-t0wvjg3","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草汇言》：\"入手、足阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-oyi1kkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-oyi1kkm","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》：\"入肝、脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-cv80nsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-cv80nsq","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入肺、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-l71tv2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-l71tv2s","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-8en2cgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-8en2cgx","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘淡，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-pwzluqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-pwzluqv","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-nldnz36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-nldnz36","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"味甘，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-ukjsept","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-ukjsept","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"淡，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-cwgwev5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-cwgwev5","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-gipni2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-gipni2a","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 湿热痢初起者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-wdfknk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-wdfknk9","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"恶芫花、齐蛤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-krjezn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-krjezn2","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"火热暴痢不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-g8kwx53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-g8kwx53","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-fp2bkww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-fp2bkww","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒，生肌，定痛。治急心痛，下痢脓血，久泻不止，胎动下血，疮痈内攻，久溃不敛，水火烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-tkdq4h9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-tkdq4h9","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤，金疮，益气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-maduyu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-maduyu5","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗久泄辩后重见白脓，补绝伤，利小儿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-w1am86w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-w1am86w","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草通玄》：\"贴疮生肌止痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-5q539er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-5q539er","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-p1wxkjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-p1wxkjq","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：溶化和服，1.5～3钱；或入丸剂。外用：溶化调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-ugf3auw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-ugf3auw","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-bdzexhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-bdzexhl","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治赤白痢，少腹痛不可忍，后重，或面青手足俱变者：黄蜡三钱，阿胶三钱。同溶化，入黄连末五钱，搅匀，分三次热服。（《纲目》仲景调气饮）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-y6057j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-y6057j0","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治产后三日内，下诸杂五色痢：阿胶一两，蜡如博棋三枚，当归一两半，黄连二两，黄柏一两，陈廪米一升。以水八升，煮米蟹目沸，去米纳药，煮取二升，去滓，纳胶、蜡令烊，分四服，一日令尽。（《千金方》胶蜡汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-c8wd5hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-c8wd5hs","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治老少下痢，食入即吐：白蜡方寸匕，鸡子黄一个，石蜜、苦酒、发灰、黄连末各半鸡子壳。先煎蜜、蜡、苦酒、鸡子四味，令匀，乃纳连、发，熬至可丸乃止，二日服尽。（华佗）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-k0zhulh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-k0zhulh","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治急心疼痛：黄蜡，灯上烧化，丸芡子大，百草霜为衣，井水下三丸。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-78o3ojg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-78o3ojg","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治妊娠胎动，腹痛下血：蜡一钱。以清酒二盏，煎三、五沸，投蜡令销，顿服。（《圣济总录》蜡酒方）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-rrm4c96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-rrm4c96","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治痈疽发背已成未脓之际.恐毒气不能外出，必致内攻，预服此丸，护膜护心，且亦散血解毒：白矾一两二钱，黄蜡一两，雄黄一钱二分，琥珀一钱（另研极细），朱砂一钱二分，蜂蜜二钱（临入）。先将白矾、雄黄、琥珀、朱砂四味碾研极细，另将蜜、蜡铜勺内熔化，离火片时，侯蜡四边稍凝时，方入上药，搅匀，共成一块，以一人将药火上微烘，众手急丸，小寒豆大，用朱砂为衣，磁罐收贮。每服二、三十丸，白汤食后送下，病甚者，早晚日进二次。（《外科正宗》琥珀蜡矾丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-rpxdv3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-rpxdv3p","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治代指：蜡、松胶。相和，火炙，笼代指。（《千金翼方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-y9jjmr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-y9jjmr5","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治小儿脚冻，如有疮：浓煎蜡涂之。（姚和众）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-fpglx8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-fpglx8r","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治臁疮、金疮、汤火等疮：黄蜡一两，香油二两，黄丹半两。同化开，顿冷，瓶收，摊贴。（《王仲勉经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-8l2ljoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-8l2ljoh","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治诸般疮毒，不拘生在何宫，初起即消，已成即溃：黄蜡一两，白矾六钱。将蜡熬化稍冷，入矾末，为丸豆大。疮在上，服一两，在下服七钱，小儿减半，酒和开水下。忌葱三日。（《医学集成》蜡矾丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-dkqz4ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-dkqz4ob","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治汤火伤疮，焮赤疼痛，毒腐成脓，用此拔热毒，止疼痛，敛疮口：麻油四两，当归一两，煎焦去滓，入黄蜡一两，搅化放冷，摊帛贴之。（《医林集要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-kf2hn18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-kf2hn18","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治破伤风湿如疟者：黄蜡一块，热酒化开服。与玉真散对用尤妙。（《瑞竹堂经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-bj08l51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-bj08l51","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治肺虚膈热，咳嗽气急；胸中烦满，肢体倦疼，咽干口苦，燥渴欲饮冷，肌瘦发热，减食嗜卧，音声不出：黄蜡（滤去滓，用浆水煮，秤）八两，蛤粉四两（研末）。上件，每两作十五丸，用前蛤粉为衣养药，每服一丸，胡桃瓤半个，细嚼温水下，临卧闭口不语。（《普济方》立效丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-yyubixk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-yyubixk","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治呃逆不止：黄蜡烧烟熏二、三次。（《医方摘要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-ythub2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-ythub2q","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治雀目：黄蜡不以多少，器内熔成汁，取出入蛤粉，相和得所成球。每用以刀子切下二钱，以猪肝二两，批开，掺药在内，麻绳扎定，水一碗，同入铫子内煮熟取出，乘热熏眼，至温冷并肝食之，日二，以平安为度。（《姚僧坦集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-rsdt0ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-rsdt0ep","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-407npe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-407npe8","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"蜜之气味俱厚，故养脾。蜡之气味俱薄，故养胃。厚者味甘而性缓质柔，故润脏腑。薄者味淡而性啬质坚，故止泄痢。张仲景治痢有调气饮，《千金方》治痢有胶蜡汤，其效甚捷，盖有见于此欤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-rblkq16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-rblkq16","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》：\"凡荡除下焦之药，以此（蜡）裹丸，亦免伤上焦之意。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-3kp9hsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-3kp9hsf","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611084520-3j8ssk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084520-3j8ssk1","updated":"20240611084520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084521-jlxrjz0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084521-jlxrjz0"}},{"ID":"20240611084911-e33qhbl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-e33qhbl","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：蜂蜡"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-38ez3zm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-38ez3zm","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-s5mybuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-s5mybuo","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fēnɡ Là"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-5u0su43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-5u0su43","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-pemwcgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-pemwcgo","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" CERA FLAVA"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-7ymzlmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-7ymzlmd","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-nf7b3bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-nf7b3bh","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为蜜蜂科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中华蜜蜂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Apis cerana Fabricius或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"意大利蜂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Apis mellifera Linnaeus"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分泌的蜡"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。将蜂巢置水中加热，滤过，冷凝取蜡或再精制而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-03utbw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-03utbw6","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-8m7k1uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-8m7k1uh","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为不规则团块，大小不一。呈黄色、淡黄棕色或黄白色，不透明或微透明，表面光滑。体较轻，蜡质，断面砂粒状，用手搓捏能软化。有蜂蜜样香气，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-uny3b1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-uny3b1u","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-2526dpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-2526dpw","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置阴凉处，防热。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-rvfie1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-rvfie1a","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-m53am7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-m53am7g","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用时熔化，澄清，除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-h2yjczn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-h2yjczn","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-rr12a9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-rr12a9x","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-mw54cnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-mw54cnz","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-pjho9bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-pjho9bt","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 收涩，敛疮，生肌，止痛。外用于溃疡不敛，臁疮糜烂，创伤，烧、烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-3q8se59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-3q8se59","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-nwy5ayf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-nwy5ayf","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用适量，熔化敷患处；常作成药赋型剂及油膏基质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-nmoijwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-nmoijwr","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-eczn18u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-eczn18u","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-8ixwvna","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-8ixwvna","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蜂蜡"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-cl7zdss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-cl7zdss","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-i4bp2hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-i4bp2hn","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fēnɡ Là"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-zr86p4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-zr86p4t","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-anl2h2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-anl2h2m","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜜蜡、蜡、蜜跖、黄蜡、白蜡、黄占"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-fs2joqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-fs2joqr","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-3qev79x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-3qev79x","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" honey-wax"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-sm0rq6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-sm0rq6q","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-hsk3915","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-hsk3915","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》；1.《别录》：白蜡，生武都山谷。生于密房木石间。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-hx16l70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-hx16l70","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经集注》：此蜜蜡尔，生于蜜中，故谓蜜蜡。蜂皆先以此为蜜ZHU、煎蜜亦得之，初时极香软，人更煮炼，或加少醋酒便黄赤、以作烛色为好。今药家皆应用白蜡，但取削之、于夏月日暴百日许，自然白；卒用之，亦可烊纳水中十余过、亦白。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-i38cuh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-i38cuh5","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草图经》：蜡，蜜脾底也，欲啖，当合大枣咀嚼即易烂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-wzgrbi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-wzgrbi5","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《纲目》：蜡乃蜜脾"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-3l315k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-3l315k8","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-kqtgiu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-kqtgiu6","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蜜蜂科动物中华蜜蜂等分泌的蜡质，经人工精制而成的块状物。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-17gdecc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-17gdecc","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Apis cerana Fabr."}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-318dpk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-318dpk1","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、秋季，将取去蜂蜜后的蜂巢，入水锅中加热熔化，除去上层泡沫杂质，趁热过滤，放冷，蜂蜡即凝结成块，浮于水面，取出，即为黄蜡。黄蜡丙经熬炼、脱色等加工过程，即成蜂蜡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-zkp4iaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-zkp4iaf","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-cwbykbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-cwbykbj","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 我国大部分地区均有养殖。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-y6j0g8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-y6j0g8q","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-uprobh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-uprobh5","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.中华蜜蜂，蜂群由工蜂、蜂王及雄蜂组成。工蜂全体被黄褐色毛。头略呈三角形。胸部3节。翅2对，膜质透明。足3对，有采集花粉的构造。腹部圆锥状，有毒腺和螫针。腹下有蜡板4 对，内有蜡腺，分泌蜡质。蜂王体最大，翅短小，腹部特长，生殖器发达，专营生殖产卵。雄蜂较工蜂稍大，头呈球形，尾无毒腺和螫针，足上无采贮花粉构造，腹无蜡板及蜡腺。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-vr2eldq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-vr2eldq","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.意大利蜜蜂，体似中华蜜蜂，但较之为大。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-195zb8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-195zb8k","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-qobbso3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-qobbso3","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.黄蜡(《金匮要略》)又名：黄占(《种福堂公选良方》)。多为不规则的块状，大 小不一，全体呈黄色或黄棕色，不透明或微透明。表面光滑，触之有油腻感。体轻，能浮于 水面，冷时质软脆，碎断面颗粒性，用手搓捏，能软化。有蜂蜜样香气，味淡，嚼之细腻而 粘。不溶于水，可溶于醚及氯仿中。以色黄、纯净、质较软而有油腻感、显蜂蜜样香气者为 佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-k24qwi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-k24qwi6","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.白蜡(《别录》)又名：蜂白蜡。为白色块状。质较纯。气味较微弱，其它均与黄蜡同。全国大部地区均有生产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-5g29ou0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-5g29ou0","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-czw1mix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-czw1mix","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.蜂蜡(蜜蜡)主要成分可分为4大类，即酯类、游离酸类、游离醇类和烃类。此外还 含微量的挥发油及色素。在酯类中有软脂酸蜂花酯(Myricyl palmitate,，约占80%，是蜂蜡主要成分)，蜡酸蜂花 酯(Myricyl cerotate),落花生油酸蜂花酯 (Myrcyl hypogaeate);在游离酸类中有蜡酸(Cer otic acid，约占15%)，甘四酸(Lignoceric acid)，褐煤酸(Montanic acid)，蜂花酸(Meli ssic acid)，叶虱酸(Psyllic acid)，落花生油酸(Hypogaeic acid)，新蜡酸(Neoceroticacid)即廿五酸；在游离醇类中有正廿八醇(n-Octacosanol)，蜂花醇(Myricyl alcohol)； 在烃类中有廿五烷(Pentacosane)，廿七烷(Heptacosane)，廿九烷(Nonacosane)，卅一烷(H entriacontane)及不饱和的蜂花烯(Melene)。以上所举，是一概略，例如所含脂酸可能包括 从C24至C34的偶数碳的正脂酸，醇类可能包括从C24至C34的偶数碳的伯醇。黄、白两种蜂蜡的成分，基本相同。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-m28955e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-m28955e","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.蜂蜡据称尚含一种芳香性有色物质，名为虫蜡素(Cer olein)。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-5w9sqz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-5w9sqz1","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-2iniqs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-2iniqs2","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.活性氨清除作用，中国产蜂蜡对来自芬顿体系的·OH和来自X/XO系的O2均有清除作用。2.5μg/ml以上浓度完全抑制脂质过氨化，还可浓义依赖性抑SOD诱导。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-nyanitz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-nyanitz","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.其他作用，蜂蜡及其乳浊液有抑菌和防腐作用。且将肝素100-150mg悬浮在蜂蜡0.5-1.5ml内，静脉注射给予，可使肝素抗凝血作用时间延长。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-2ylvk56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-2ylvk56","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-ciyhtat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-ciyhtat","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾；胃；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-2b00rvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-2b00rvc","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-5a6wusz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-5a6wusz","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；淡；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-kidxxoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-kidxxoa","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-j582epd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-j582epd","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒；生肌；止痢；止血；定痛。主痈疽发背，溃疡为敛；急心痛；下痢脓血；久泻不止；胎动下血；遗精；带下"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-pez7xn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-pez7xn8","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-7qddnpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-7qddnpm","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：溶化和服，5-10g；或入丸剂。外用：适量，溶化调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-okwuxrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-okwuxrz","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-1iygog6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-1iygog6","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治赤白痢，少腹痛不可忍，后重，或面青手足俱变者：黄蜡三钱，阿胶三钱。同溶 化，入黄连末五钱，搅匀，分三次热服。(《金匮要略》调气饮)②治产后三日内，下诸杂五色痢：阿胶一两，蜡如博棋三枚，当归一两半，黄连二两，黄柏 一两，陈廪米一升。以水八升，煮米蟹目沸，去米纳药，煮取二升，去滓，纳胶、蜡令烊， 分四服，一日令尽。(《千金方》胶蜡汤)③治老少下痢，食入即吐：白蜡方寸匕，鸡子黄一个，石蜜、苦酒、发灰、黄连末各半鸡子 壳。先煎蜜、蜡、苦酒、鸡子四味，令匀，乃纳连、发，熬至可丸乃止，二日服尽。(华佗)④治急心疼痛：黄蜡，灯上烧化，丸芡子大，百年霜为衣，井水下三丸。(《纲目》)⑤治妊娠胎动，腹痛下血：蜡一钱。以清酒二盏，煎三、五沸，投蜡令销，顿服。(《圣济 总录》蜡酒方)⑥治痈疽发背已成未脓之际，恐毒气不能外出，必致内攻，预服此丸，护膜护心，且亦散血 解毒：白矾一两二钱，黄蜡一两，雄黄一钱二分，琥珀一钱(另研极细)，朱砂一钱二分，蜂 蜜二钱(临入)。先将白矾、雄黄、琥珀、朱砂四味碾研极细，另将蜜、蜡铜勺内熔化，离火 片时，候蜡四边稍凝时，方入上药，搅匀，共成一块，以一人将药火上微烘，众手急丸，小 寒豆大，用朱砂为衣，磁罐收贮。每服二、三十丸，白汤食后送下，病甚者，早晚日进二次 。(《外科正宗》琥珀蜡矾丸)⑦治代指：蜡、松胶。相和，火炙，笼代指。(《千金翼方》)⑧治小儿脚冻，如有疮：浓煎蜡涂之。(姚和众)⑨治臁疮、金疮、汤火等疮：黄蜡一两，香油二两，黄丹半两。同化开，顿冷，瓶收，摊贴 。(《王仲勉经验方》)⑩治诸般疮毒，不拘生在何宫，初起即消，已成即溃：黄蜡一两，白矾六钱。将蜡熬化稍冷 ，入矾末，为丸豆大。疮在上，服一两，在下服七钱，小儿减半，酒和开水下。忌葱三日。 (《医学集成》)蜡矾丸)(11)治汤火伤疮，赤疼痛，毒腐成脓，用此拔热毒，止疼痛，敛疮口：麻油四两，当归一两，煎焦去滓，入黄蜡一两，搅化放冷，摊帛贴之。(《医林集要》)(12)治被伤风湿如疟者：黄蜡一块，热酒化开服。与玉真散对用尤妙。(《瑞竹堂经验方》)(13)治肺虚隔热，咳嗽气急，胸中烦满，肢体倦疼，咽干口苦，燥渴欲饮冷，肌瘦发热，减食嗜卧，音声不出：黄蜡(滤去滓，用浆水煮，秤)八两，蛤粉四两(研末)。上件，每两作十五丸，用前蛤粉为农养药，每服一丸，胡桃瓤半个，细口爵温水下，临卧闭口不语。(《普济方》立效丸)(14)治呃逆不止：黄蜡烧烟熏二、三次。(《医方摘要》)（15）治雀目：黄蜡不以多少，器内熔成汁，取出入蛤粉，相和得所成球。每用以刀子切下二钱，以猪肝二两，批开，掺药在内，麻绳扎定，水一碗，同入铫子内煮熟取出，乘热熏眼，至温冷并肝食之，日二，以平安为度。(《姚僧坦集验方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-ddj5wbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-ddj5wbe","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-ojck2b9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-ojck2b9","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：蜜之气味俱厚，故养脾。蜡之气味俱薄，故养胃。厚者味甘而性缓质柔，故润脏腑。薄者味淡而性啬质坚，故止泄痢。张仲景治痢有调气饮，《千金方》治痢有胶蜡汤，其效甚捷，盖有见于此欤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-x96zp7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-x96zp7x","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草求真》：凡荡除下焦之药，以此(蜡)裹丸，亦免伤上焦之意。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-sgirxc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-sgirxc4","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主下痢脓血，补中，续绝伤，金疮，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-qzlb2nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-qzlb2nx","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：疗久泄辟后重见白脓，补绝伤，利小儿。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-nxy4ofi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-nxy4ofi","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草通玄》：贴疮生肌止痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-mtlfwit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-mtlfwit","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-whui3eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-whui3eb","updated":"20240611084911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611084911-s8be25m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-s8be25m","updated":"20240611084911"}},{"ID":"20240611084911-ihw33aj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611084911-ihw33aj","updated":"20240611084911"}}]}